  "title": "(#46) 용수철의 탄성계수 변화에 따른 물체의 왕복 운동 분석",
  "author": "최효석(영서중학교)",
  "userid": "B9K5y",
  "created": "26.05.10",
  "viewCnt": 99,
  "commentCnt": 2,
  "headCont": "",
  "contentval": "0001Kzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/82",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">이번 실험은 무게센서를 센서로서 쓰지 않고<br>아주 적절한 플라스틱 원판으로 썼습니다.<br><br>추와 함께 질량을 측정하고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9a40ff0019e1c16c6e6a0ff4fd1682d8ecd838e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9a40ff0019e1c16c6e6a0ff4fd1682d8ecd838e\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">용수철의 탄성계수도 미리 측정해두었습니다.<br>기본 용수철은 19.25N/m=k라고 하면</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f9a21f8990ce220b82e38b42f007508174db35a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f9a21f8990ce220b82e38b42f007508174db35a\" data-origin-width=\"138\" data-origin-height=\"156\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">병렬 연결한 용수철은 42.46N/m=2.21k 정도 </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/675c8301289ea13b79a4ad0702b2a75b9c22eb59\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/675c8301289ea13b79a4ad0702b2a75b9c22eb59\" data-origin-width=\"138\" data-origin-height=\"125\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">직렬 연결한 용수철은 10.92N/m=0.57k 정도입니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/718b2e58c66dab0641261c1338f9539b65e4f92a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/718b2e58c66dab0641261c1338f9539b65e4f92a\" data-origin-width=\"138\" data-origin-height=\"210\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">용수철은 이렇게 생겼습니다ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e45c7b543acbece8d67340eacaca2699ca9929e4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e45c7b543acbece8d67340eacaca2699ca9929e4\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이건 기본 용수철</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e95c71d9f9f4a067b024eec78f623eaa9ef810f2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e95c71d9f9f4a067b024eec78f623eaa9ef810f2\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이건 병렬 연결 용수철</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac295bdeca3ed6031ce5644a8b5ed645a838cc02\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac295bdeca3ed6031ce5644a8b5ed645a838cc02\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이건 직렬 연결 용수철입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c9080937e4ba6e993221f305a00ae396ebdc6cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c9080937e4ba6e993221f305a00ae396ebdc6cf\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">물체가 중력-용수철과 평형을 이룬 상태에서<br>대략 5cm 당겨서 초음파 센서로 운동을 분석했습니다.<br><br>그 결과를 GPT에 돌려서 분석을 시작했습니다.<br>확실히 중앙 기준으로 위쪽은 탄성계수가 높고<br>아래쪽은 탄성계수다 낮아서<br>주기의 차이가 극명하게 보이네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/179320a5cc9c651157edcaf1dab76a1eb3ef20a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/179320a5cc9c651157edcaf1dab76a1eb3ef20a7\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"447\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">정말 신기한건, 이론으로 구한 주기와<br>실제 실험 주기가 그리 차이가 많이 안난다는 것입니다. (이거는 공기저항?)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/686c8035cc0935ffba253b3a481b1ca63205cecb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/686c8035cc0935ffba253b3a481b1ca63205cecb\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"370\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그리고 GPT가 잘 분석해서 수식까지 줍니다<br>이걸로 물체의 최대 진폭과 최대 속력을 알 수 있죠</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5d56e513e8d9cc94883b935c7b2b5caedf7552cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5d56e513e8d9cc94883b935c7b2b5caedf7552cb\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"247\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그것을 통해, 아래 수식에 넣어서<br>탄성에너지와 운동에너지를 계산을 합니다.<br>막 똑같지는 않으나 어느 정도 비슷한 모습을 보입니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00b94d47ff19b0d3be629967c29d9b68e0797b98\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00b94d47ff19b0d3be629967c29d9b68e0797b98\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"304\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1c98787a88aaae723f9cf14d340cdd67c6611dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1c98787a88aaae723f9cf14d340cdd67c6611dd\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"657\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">AI랑 대화하면서 실험 결과를 분석하니까<br>생각보다 옆에 친구하나 두고 실험 분석하는 것 같아서 꽤나 쓸만하더라고요<br>그림도 잘 그려주고ㅋㅋㅋㅋ 수식도 바로 만들어주고!<br><br>아무튼 추천해볼만한 실험입니다ㅎㅎ!!<br><br>가이드북으로 내용은 아래와 같이 정리했습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/487ae1485a00c7d0041965f43ff2286572d807e2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/487ae1485a00c7d0041965f43ff2286572d807e2\" data-origin-width=\"1066\" data-origin-height=\"1426\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45e62c300d3ac900d7ca9ffd66f03603e8d5256d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45e62c300d3ac900d7ca9ffd66f03603e8d5256d\" data-origin-width=\"1075\" data-origin-height=\"1445\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f222f8b6758c928bbad746a04157422ce15b3c5f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f222f8b6758c928bbad746a04157422ce15b3c5f\" data-origin-width=\"1075\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47910914b86ea6f9945123905368826d182e2353\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/47910914b86ea6f9945123905368826d182e2353\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1073\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a>